कुण् कुण्, cl. 6. P. कुणति, -णितुम्, to sound;
to cherish, to support or aid with gifts &c.;
to be in pain (?); cl. 10. P. कुणयति, -यितुम्, to
counsel or advise; to converse with, to speak to,
address; to salute; to invite; [cf. Lat. cano, sono;
Lith. zwanu.]

कुण्ठक, अस्, आ, अम्, stupid, ignorant, a fool;
(अस्), m., N. of a pupil of Luṇṭaka; (आस्), m. pl., N.
of a people.

कुण्ड् कुण्ड्, cl. 1. P. कुण्डति, to mutilate;
cl. 1. A. कुण्डते, -डितुम्, to burn; cl.
10. P. कुण्डयति, -यितुम्, to protect.
